{"title":"Clearance · Up To 65% Off","description":"\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eShop Artificial Christmas Trees at Reduced Prices\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eClearance Christmas trees from Carol's Christmas Conifers offer the best artificial Christmas trees at a reduced price. This collection includes open-box and final sale items, offering an opportunity to purchase high-quality designs at exceptional value.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eEach tree in our clearance collection is crafted with the same attention to detail, durability, and craftsmanship as our full price products. Whether you're looking for a realistic artificial Christmas tree, a pre-lit option, or a space-saving design, our clearance selection makes it easy to find a beautiful tree at a lower price. Clearance items are available in limited quantities and may sell out quickly, so we recommend purchasing while inventory lasts.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhy shop clearance Christmas trees?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eClearance Christmas trees offer the same quality and design as our standard collection, just at a discounted price. These items may include limited inventory or open-box products, making them a great option for customers looking to purchase the perfect tree at an accessible price point. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat does Final Sale mean?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eItems in our clearance collection are considered final sale and are not eligible for returns or exchanges. These products may include open box items or limited remaining inventory offered at a discounted price. While these products are final sale, they are backed by our 90 day warranty. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e does \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eopen-box mean?\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAn open-box product is one that was previously returned, most often because the original purchaser selected a different size to better fit their space.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAll open-box items undergo a quality control process to ensure they are complete, fully functional, and meet our standards. This allows you to shop with confidence while enjoying additional savings.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAre clearance Christmas trees good quality?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eYes, clearance artificial Christmas trees are held to the same quality standards as all of our Carol's Christmas Conifers products. Whether open-box or final sale, each tree is inspected to ensure it meets our expectations for performance and appearance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhether you're looking for a high-quality artificial Christmas tree at a reduced price or searching for limited-time savings, our clearance collection offers an excellent opportunity to bring home the perfect tree for less. Explore our selection to find the right tree for your space before inventory sells out.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"open-box-of-7-5-king-flock-slim-warm-white-led-lights","title":"7.5' King Flock® Slim Tree with Warm White LED Lights - OPEN BOX - FINAL SALE","description":"\u003cp\u003eJust admit it, we all know why you're here. You might have seen it at a friend's place, or perhaps your cousin won't quit it with how stunning theirs looks, or maybe you're checking in to see if all that Instagram hype is real. Whether you live in a warm climate, craving wintry vibes, or you just wanna experience a winter wonderland from the comfort of your living room while the weather outside is frightful. The King Flock Slim Tree is a perfect choice this Christmas to stash your gifts beneath and soak up the holiday spirit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n \n\n \u003cp\u003eA tapered version of the King Flock tree, the King Flock Slim is one of our premier signature trees. It features state of the art design with a blend of realistic tips (PE) and classic tips (PVC) resulting in a grand and beautiful hallmark Christmas tree.\u003c\/p\u003e\n \n\n \u003cp\u003eWith heavily flocked tips, you can enjoy the look of freshly fallen snow adorning each branch of your tree. So let it snow this holiday season while sipping eggnog, and marvel at this wondrous masterpiece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"","offer_id":32792237572173,"sku":"OPEN-KFS-T7.5-L","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlockSlim_bfdc82d9-1304-4746-8824-a6cb9508bcef.jpg?v=1757012105"},{"product_id":"open-7-king-noble-fir-tree-unlit","title":"7' King Noble Fir Tree Unlit - OPEN BOX - FINAL SALE","description":"\u003cp\u003eContinuing down the imaginary aisle of Christmas trees, next up we introduce the King Noble Fir Tree. Sporadic by design, this tree was designed for the minimalist. Don't be fooled, with its sturdy construction, this majestic and noble tree is capable of handling any ornaments you adorn it with. With a flame-retardant construction, you can have confidence that your tree is safe while enjoying the warmth and beauty your new Christmas tree adds to your home. A durable and strong metal core offers robust support so your tree stays upright and maintains its shape. Convenient hinged partitions allow for a simple set up and displaying your beautiful King Noble Fir Christmas Tree.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"","offer_id":37836706218184,"sku":"OPEN-KNF-T7-U","price":199.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-3_c781f95d-87b3-4699-8b60-2cd8a487c7f5.jpg?v=1718157862"},{"product_id":"open-box-9-king-noble-fir-artificial-christmas-tree-unlit-final-sale","title":"9' King Noble Fir Tree Unlit - OPEN BOX - FINAL SALE","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"","offer_id":37836800458952,"sku":"OPEN-KNF-T9-U","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-3_2c36c16c-8bb3-48ac-b4f0-b0b032d9a23e.jpg?v=1718157985"},{"product_id":"open-box-7-5-king-flock-tree-led-lights","title":"7.5' King Flock® Tree with Warm White LED Lights - OPEN BOX - FINAL SALE","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"","offer_id":41228440862920,"sku":"OPEN-KF-T7.5-L","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/8KingFlockTreewithWarmwhiteLedLights_4d78403d-091a-49c6-9165-4d717a649cc4.jpg?v=1732028259"},{"product_id":"openbox-9-king-noble-flock-unlit","title":"9' King Noble Flock Tree Unlit - OPEN BOX - FINAL SALE","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"","offer_id":41317602001096,"sku":"OPEN-KNFL-T9-U","price":199.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingNobleFlock_5f4659c6-5d82-4165-9edb-de0efd368efa.jpg?v=1722888266"},{"product_id":"open-7-foot-tribeca-blue-spruce-tree-led","title":"7' Tribeca Blue Spruce Tree with Warm White LED Lights - OPEN BOX - FINAL SALE","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the joy and natural beauty of a Colorado winter into your home with our Tribeca Spruce, inspired by the magnificent Colorado Blue Spruce. Expertly handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, each tree flawlessly replicates the bluish-green needles and elegant form of a genuine Blue Spruce tree. Perfect for festive gatherings, it adds warmth, charm, and holiday cheer to any space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"","offer_id":41403856912584,"sku":"OPEN-TBS-T7-L","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/TribecaSpruceFINALSALE.jpg?v=1757011142"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-rushmore-flock-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Rushmore Flock Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit - FINAL SALE","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the forests near Mt. Rushmore to the heart of your home, experience the timeless beauty of this majestic tree during the holidays. Expertly crafted to capture the beauty of the Ponderosa Pine, its layered branches and lifelike detail make it practically indistinguishable from the real tree. A striking centerpiece, it brings the genuine magic of the holiday season to your family traditions.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"","offer_id":41404936421576,"sku":"RUSFLOCK-T7.5-U","price":199.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RushmoreFlock_b4094336-287b-4d8d-9318-a353bcee6582.jpg?v=1722889125"},{"product_id":"open-box-8-king-noble-fir-artificial-christmas-tree-unlit-final-sale","title":"8' King Noble Fir Tree Unlit - OPEN BOX - FINAL SALE","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"","offer_id":43034124845256,"sku":"OPEN-KNF-T8-U","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/FlockedGroup-3_01e2a61f-e14f-4296-8231-4b199130f721.jpg?v=1718157962"},{"product_id":"openbox-8ft-flock-slim-artificial-christmas-tree-unlit","title":"8' King Flock® Slim Tree Unlit - OPEN BOX - FINAL SALE","description":"\u003cp\u003eTurn your home into a magical winter wonderland this holiday season with the King Flock - a handcrafted work of art that captures the essence of a frosty Christmas morning with its realistic \"fresh snow\" appearance. This tree mimics the enchanting look of the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Revel in the authentic charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Explore now and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"","offer_id":43900902506696,"sku":"OPEN-KFS-T8-U","price":189.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-4_f5bbeacc-14ff-495d-82d5-436854424858.jpg?v=1718158900"},{"product_id":"8-king-flock-artificial-christmas-tree-unlit-sale","title":"8' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit - FINAL SALE","description":"\u003cp\u003eTurn your home into a magical winter wonderland this holiday season with the King Flock - a handcrafted work of art that captures the essence of a frosty Christmas morning with its realistic \"fresh snow\" appearance. This tree mimics the enchanting look of the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Revel in the authentic charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Explore now and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"","offer_id":44255311233224,"sku":"DEAL-KF-T8-U","price":199.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-tree_847c3c9c-cbda-4b9e-9f13-d9cce2ce784f.jpg?v=1718158894"},{"product_id":"openbox-6-5-king-flock-slim-tree","title":"6.5' King Flock® Slim Tree Unlit - OPEN BOX - FINAL SALE","description":"Turn your home into a magical winter wonderland this holiday season with the King Flock - a handcrafted work of art that captures the essence of a frosty Christmas morning with its realistic \"fresh snow\" appearance. This tree mimics the enchanting look of the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Revel in the authentic charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Explore now and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEffortless Assembly: Don't spend hours on preparation. Enjoy quick, easy setup and start decorating in no time with our user-friendly tree.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSturdy Metal Stand: Rest assured your tree will stand tall and stable throughout the holiday festivities, thanks to the strong supporting stand that is included.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVarious Heights: Whether you have a cozy apartment or a grand living room, find the perfect tree size to fit your beloved space. \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFire-Resistant: Celebrate with confidence knowing that your tree is built with fire-resistant materials, ensuring a safe and joyous holiday season.\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDurable Build: Handcrafted with premium materials, our Christmas tree is designed to be a centerpiece of your holiday decor for seasons to come.\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStorage Bag: Our exclusive zippered storage bag ensures your tree can be conveniently packed away and transported with ease.\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003eA tapered version of the King Flock tree, the King Flock is one of our premier signature trees. It features state of the art design with a blend of realistic tips (PE) and classic tips (PVC) resulting in a grand and beautiful hallmark Christmas tree. With heavily flocked tips, you can enjoy the look of freshly fallen snow adorning each branch of your tree. So let it snow this holiday season while sipping eggnog, and marvel at this wondrous masterpiece.","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"","offer_id":44255412748488,"sku":"OPEN-KFS-T6.5-U","price":149.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-4_e7d10a3a-8506-4193-a238-f2c4735477fb.jpg?v=1718158125"},{"product_id":"deal-8-king-flock-slim-led","title":"8' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 700 Warm White LED Lights - FINAL SALE","description":"\u003cp\u003eTurn your home into a magical winter wonderland this holiday season with the King Flock - a handcrafted work of art that captures the essence of a frosty Christmas morning with its realistic \"fresh snow\" appearance. This tree mimics the enchanting look of the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Revel in the authentic charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Explore now and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"","offer_id":44260073373896,"sku":"DEAL-KFS-T8-L","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlockSlim_d47da14f-0af4-4443-b11f-1709e5f77f2b.jpg?v=1714673470"},{"product_id":"finalsale-8-king-flock-led","title":"8' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 900 Warm White LED Lights - FINAL SALE","description":"Turn your home into a magical winter wonderland this holiday season with the King Flock - a handcrafted work of art that captures the essence of a frosty Christmas morning with its realistic \"fresh snow\" appearance. This tree mimics the enchanting look of the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Revel in the authentic charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Explore now and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e        Power Pole Technology: Say goodbye to tangled wires and complicated setups. Our tree's seamless power connection lets you instantly light up your space without the hassle.\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e        Pre-Lit Option: Immerse yourself in the warm glow of professionally arranged lights, carefully camouflaged to ensure an elegant, clean look with minimally visible wiring.\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEffortless Assembly: Don't spend hours on preparation. Enjoy quick, easy setup and start decorating in no time with our user-friendly tree.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSturdy Metal Stand: Rest assured your tree will stand tall and stable throughout the holiday festivities, thanks to the strong supporting stand that is included.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVarious Heights: Whether you have a cozy apartment or a grand living room, find the perfect tree size to fit your beloved space. \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFire-Resistant: Celebrate with confidence knowing that your tree is built with fire-resistant materials, ensuring a safe and joyous holiday season.\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDurable Build: Handcrafted with premium materials, our Christmas tree is designed to be a centerpiece of your holiday decor for seasons to come.\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStorage Bag: Our exclusive zippered storage bag ensures your tree can be conveniently packed away and transported with ease.\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003eA tapered version of the King Flock tree, the King Flock Slim is one of our premier signature trees. It features state of the art design with a blend of realistic tips (PE) and classic tips (PVC) resulting in a grand and beautiful hallmark Christmas tree. With heavily flocked tips, you can enjoy the look of freshly fallen snow adorning each branch of your tree. So let it snow this holiday season while sipping eggnog, and marvel at this wondrous masterpiece.","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"","offer_id":44260076191944,"sku":"DEAL-KF-T8-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlock_f31f42a4-252b-4076-a5c8-14e0a064ae3f.jpg?v=1714673360"},{"product_id":"9-king-flock-artificial-led-final-sale","title":"9' King Flock® Tree with Warm White LED Lights - FINAL SALE","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"","offer_id":44317543170248,"sku":"DEAL-KF-T9-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlock_fa57f85a-e2a6-4c97-890c-65a451ccd556.jpg?v=1714673362"},{"product_id":"12-king-flock-slim-tree-unlit-final-sale","title":"12' King Flock® Slim Tree Unlit - FINAL SALE","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"","offer_id":44750807400648,"sku":"DEAL-KFS-T12-U","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-4_48691cb5-86a9-432a-b360-f10ba7015d3e.jpg?v=1718157857"},{"product_id":"openbox-6-5-king-fraser-fir-led","title":"6.5' King Fraser Fir Tree with Warm White LED Lights - OPEN BOX - FINAL SALE","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the holiday season with the natural splendor 